<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>QualiteApps - Soluções Discord Premium</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/animate.css/4.1.1/animate.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --roxo-vivo: #8A2BE2;
            --azul-tech: #00B4D8;
            --verde-fresh: #00C853;
            --verde-botao: #2ecc71;
            --preto-profundo: #121212;
            --cinza-claro: #f5f5f5;
            --destaque: #000000;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--preto-profundo);
            color: white;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* Header Moderno */
        header {
            background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 15px 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .logo:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .logo img {
            height: 40px;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .logo:hover img {
            transform: rotate(15deg);
        }

        .logo span {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--roxo-vivo), var(--azul-tech));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            position: relative;
        }

        .logo span::after {
            content: "Premium";
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            right: -25px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            background: var(--destaque);
            color: #000;
            padding: 2px 5px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Hero Section Impactante */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.2) 0%, transparent 40%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.2) 0%, transparent 40%),
                        var(--preto-profundo);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 60vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .typing-container {
            min-height: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, white, #e0e0e0);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero .typing-text {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--azul-tech);
            height: 60px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        /* Seção de Planos Premium */
        .plans-section {
            padding: 30px 0 80px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .plans-section::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.02)" d="M0,0 L100,0 L100,100 Q50,80 0,100 L0,0 Z"></path></svg>');
            background-size: 100% auto;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: top;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 20px;
            width: calc(100% - 40px);
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--roxo-vivo), var(--azul-tech), var(--verde-fresh));
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .section-description {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 50px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .plans-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
            scroll-padding: 0 20px;
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            scrollbar-width: thin;
            scrollbar-color: var(--roxo-vivo) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .plans-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
            height: 8px;
        }

        .plans-container::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .plans-container::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--roxo-vivo), var(--azul-tech));
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .plan-card {
            scroll-snap-align: center;
            flex: 0 0 350px;
            background: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s forwards;
            transform-origin: bottom;
        }

        .plan-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 5px;
        }

        .plan-card.popular::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--roxo-vivo), #BA55D3);
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(2)::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--azul-tech), #00D4FF);
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(3)::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--verde-fresh), #00E676);
        }

        .plan-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-15px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .plan-card:active {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.01);
        }

        .popular-tag {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--roxo-vivo), #9B30FF);
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.3);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        .plan-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin: 10px 0 5px;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .plan-title::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .plan-card.popular .plan-title::after {
            background: var(--roxo-vivo);
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(2) .plan-title::after {
            background: var(--azul-tech);
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(3) .plan-title::after {
            background: var(--verde-fresh);
        }

        .plan-card.popular .plan-title {
            color: var(--roxo-vivo);
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(2) .plan-title {
            color: var(--azul-tech);
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(3) .plan-title {
            color: var(--verde-fresh);
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 20px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .price small {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .price-annotation {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            margin-top: -15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .plan-features {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .plan-features li {
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .plan-features li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .plan-features li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            color: var(--verde-fresh);
        }

        .cta-button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.4s;
            margin-top: 25px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .cta-button::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);
            transform: translateX(-100%);
            transition: transform 0.6s;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .cta-button:hover::before {
            transform: translateX(100%);
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .cta-button:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .plan-card.popular .cta-button {
            background: var(--roxo-vivo);
            color: white;
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(2) .cta-button {
            background: var(--azul-tech);
            color: white;
        }

        .plan-card:nth-child(3) .cta-button {
            background: var(--verde-fresh);
            color: white;
        }

        /* Botão Discord */
        .discord-btn {
            background: var(--verde-botao) !important;
            color: white !important;
            padding: 8px 16px !important;
            border-radius: 6px !important;
            text-decoration: none !important;
            font-size: 0.9rem !important;
            font-weight: 600 !important;
            transition: all 0.3s !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3) !important;
            border: none !important;
        }

        .discord-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.4) !important;
            background: #27ae60 !important;
        }

        .discord-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0) !important;
        }

        /* Seção de Funcionalidades */
        .features-section {
            padding: 60px 0;
            background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.7);
            position: relative;
        }

        .features-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.6);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .feature-icon-large {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--roxo-vivo), var(--azul-tech));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .feature-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .feature-description {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Rodapé Premium */
        footer {
            background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.95);
            padding: 70px 0 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-logo:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .footer-logo img {
            height: 45px;
        }

        .footer-logo span {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--roxo-vivo), var(--azul-tech));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            padding: 5px 0;
        }

        .footer-links a::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--azul-tech);
            transition: width 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .social-icons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .social-icon {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .social-icon:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.1);
        }

        .social-icon:nth-child(1):hover {
            background: #5865F2;
        }

        .social-icon:nth-child(2):hover {
            background: #1DA1F2;
        }

        .social-icon:nth-child(3):hover {
            background: #E1306C;
        }

        .copyright {
            margin-top: 40px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Elementos Flutuantes */
        .floating-elements {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .floating-element {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0.1;
            animation: float 15s infinite linear;
        }

        .floating-element:nth-child(1) {
            top: 10%;
            left: 10%;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: var(--roxo-vivo);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation-delay: 0s;
        }

        .floating-element:nth-child(2) {
            top: 70%;
            left: 80%;
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: var(--azul-tech);
            border-radius: 30% 70% 70% 30% / 30% 30% 70% 70%;
            animation-delay: 3s;
        }

        .floating-element:nth-child(3) {
            top: 30%;
            left: 60%;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: var(--verde-fresh);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation-delay: 6s;
        }

        /* Animações */
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(50px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            from {
                transform: rotate(0deg);
            }
            to {
                transform: rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-50px) rotate(180deg);
            }
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.7);
            }
            70% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(138, 43, 226, 0);
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(138, 43, 226, 0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes typing {
            from { width: 0 }
            to { width: 100% }
        }

        @keyframes blink-caret {
            from, to { border-color: transparent }
            50% { border-color: var(--azul-tech) }
        }

        .animate-delay-1 {
            animation-delay: 0.2s;
        }

        .animate-delay-2 {
            animation-delay: 0.4s;
        }

        .animate-delay-3 {
            animation-delay: 0.6s;
        }

        /* Efeito de Scroll Suave */
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        /* Responsividade */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }
            
            .hero .typing-text {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
                height: 50px;
            }
            
            .plan-card {
                flex: 0 0 320px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .hero .typing-text {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
                height: 40px;
            }
            
            .hero p {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            
            .plan-card {
                flex: 0 0 280px;
                padding: 25px;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .price {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .footer-links {
                gap: 15px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .hero .typing-text {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                height: 30px;
            }
            
            .hero-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <nav>
                <div class="logo">
                    <img src="/assets/logo.png" alt="QualiteApps">
                    <span>QualiteApps</span>
                </div>
                <% if (!user) { %>
                    <a href="/auth/discord" class="discord-btn animate__animated animate__fadeIn">
                        Entrar com Discord
                    </a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
                        <img src="<%= user.avatarUrl %>" alt="Avatar" width="40" style="border-radius: 50%;">
                        <span style="font-weight: 500;"><%= user.username %></span>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="floating-elements">
            <div class="floating-element"></div>
            <div class="floating-element"></div>
            <div class="floating-element"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="hero-content container">
            <h1 class="animate__animated animate__fadeInDown">Potencialize seu servidor do discord</h1>
            <div class="typing-container">
                <div class="typing-text" id="typing-text"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="animate__animated animate__fadeIn animate__delay-1s">Soluções profissionais para comunidades que buscam excelência. Ferramentas premium para moderadores, administradores e donos de servidores.</p>
            <% if (!user) { %>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#plans" class="cta-button animate__animated animate__fadeInUp animate__delay-2s" style="
                        background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--roxo-vivo), #9B30FF);
                        color: white;
                        text-decoration: none;
                        min-width: 200px;
                    ">
                        <i class="fas fa-crown"></i> Ver Planos
                    </a>
                    <a href="/auth/discord" class="cta-button animate__animated animate__fadeInUp animate__delay-3s" style="
                        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
                        color: white;
                        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
                        text-decoration: none;
                        min-width: 200px;
                    ">
                        <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Comece Agora
                    </a>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plans-section" id="plans">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title animate__animated animate__fadeIn">Nossos Planos Premium</h2>
            <p class="section-description animate__animated animate__fadeIn animate__delay-1s">Escolha o plano perfeito para suas necessidades. Todos incluem suporte dedicado e atualizações constantes.</p>
            
            <div class="plans-container" id="plans-container">
                <!-- Plano Epro (Popular) -->
                <div class="plan-card popular animate__animated" style="animation-name: fadeInUp;">
                    <span class="popular-tag">Plano popular</span>
                    <h3 class="plan-title">Epro Completo</h3>
                    <div class="price">R$ 6,99 <small>/mês</small></div>
                    <div class="price-annotation">ou R$ 75,4 por ano (10% off)</div>
